          "type": "text",
          "text": "Ethiopic script font designed in a handwritten style.\n\nThe Geʾez Handwriting Outlines is a style the forms the letter strokes with a sequence of circular dots. The intent of this style is to assist learners through practice where they may trace of the dots to learn the hand motions.\n\nThis font is part of a collection of 14 typefaces developed to help teach handwriting to children.\n\nProject Homepage: https://github.com/raeytype/geez-handwriting-fonts"
        }
      ]
    }
